/E (The Conference on Sociotechnical Cybersecurity and Privacy \(SCP\) brings together researchers and practitioners from fields such as computer science, engineering, psychology, social sciences, and economics to explore the relationship between people, technology, security, and privacy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
