139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Created from the merger of the EuroUSEC and STAST communities, SCP focuses on human-centered approaches to cybersecurity and privacy. The conference highlights the idea that effective security depends not only on technical solutions but also on understanding human behavior, system design, and organizational practices. SCP provides a platform to discuss innovative research and practical solutions for building secure, usable, and trustworthy digital systems.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
